From 762bd7386e2f4847c83559363378b06df37b100e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jian-Ming Wang <jian.ming.wang@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Mar 2026 07:48:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Fixed incorrect health status from OperationalStatus.
 Added to support rated power input and output reading.

Example for EM configuration:

      "Labels": [
        "temp1",
        "pin",
        "pout1",
        "vin",
        "vout1",
        "iin",
        "iout1",
        "rated_maxpout1"
      ]
        ...
      "rated_maxpin_Name": "PSU $ADDRESS % 80 PIN CAP PWR_W",
      "rated_maxpout1_Name": "PSU $ADDRESS % 80 POUT1 CAP PWR_W",
        ...
      "Type": "pmbus"


Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
---
 src/psu/PSUEvent.cpp      |  7 ++++---
 src/psu/PSUSensor.cpp     | 19 ++++++++++++++++++-
 src/psu/PSUSensor.hpp     | 11 +++++++++++
 src/psu/PSUSensorMain.cpp | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/psu/PSUEvent.cpp b/src/psu/PSUEvent.cpp
index bc04523..3761625 100644
--- a/src/psu/PSUEvent.cpp
+++ b/src/psu/PSUEvent.cpp
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@
